    <p class="lead">Are you interested in understanding how we might prevent the next pandemic? Curious about the history and future of biowarfare, the promises and perils of biotech, and how governments, scientists, NGOs and philanthropists are working to improve global biosecurity?</p>
    <p>Fill out this <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/12mvWKM3RNZwzxMOIT0LWWKJ6IDU2s7XyI7gOYVZWUkk/edit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">interest form</a> to participate in this semester's Biosecurity Fellowship! We will have nine weekly meetings to discuss readings that explore the risks of natural and artificial pandemics, the most promising technical and policy research frontiers, biosecurity career opportunities and much more.</p>
